capability_routing_ratchet
  issue 1138
  purpose "Routing quality is measured, not asserted. Seven intents, five languages, twelve paraphrases each, against data/benchmarks/capability-routing/."
  checker "rust-script scripts/check-capability-routing.rs"
  plan "docs/case-studies/issue-1138/plans/10-intent-routing.md leaves 1-3"
  direction_note "Six of these measures ratchet upward, which plan 00 section 6.7 admits as a declared exception. Each states its direction in its own `direction` field, and the checker fails in both directions either way (plan 00 section 9 X6)."
  baseline "Measured on 2026-09-16 by `scripts/check-capability-routing.rs`. Runtime outcomes come from `cargo run --example measure_capability_routing`; corpus dimensions and remaining routing debt are derived from the current tree. The earlier 0-of-420 run is retained in plan 14's wave I9 report, while every value below is an exact current measurement rather than a target."
