    how "cases of data/benchmarks/capability-routing/ whose expected_capability is the capability actually routed to, counted by `cargo run --example measure_capability_routing`"
    note "measured 420 of 420 on 2026-09-16 with plan 10 leaves 9-17 landed; the run before them was 0"
  ceiling
