    value 0
    direction down
    how "cases of data/benchmarks/capability-routing/ that reach their case's prohibited_capability, counted by `cargo run --example measure_capability_routing`"
    note "measured 0 on 2026-09-18. This is the #745 and #758 defect counted directly, and it may only fall. The ledger previously recorded 280 here, which was the cue-phrase count transposed, not a measurement; the honest value is the measured one."
  ceiling
    measure silent_unknowns
    value 0
    direction down
    how "cases that reach no capability at all -- an honest gap or an ask rather than a route -- counted by `cargo run --example measure_capability_routing`"
    note "measured 0 on 2026-09-16; the run before plan 10 leaves 9-17 was 420, every case an honest ask."
  ceiling
    measure memorized_capability_cues
    value 40
    direction down
    how "quoted cue values below cues blocks in data/seed/agentic-tool-capabilities.lino"
    note "measured 280 until plan 10 leaf 11 deleted the seven cues blocks; measured 0 after them (2026-09-18). The ceiling had been written as 0 before the deletion and failed the exact check for that commit's worth of history -- recorded here so the strictness held in the open. On 2026-09-20 the issue #1021 routing fix reintroduced one cues block under the grep capability: forty multilingual phrases that longest_search_cue in src/agentic_coding/shell_command.rs matches by longest phrase to route code-search requests to rg, because the shell-intent vocabulary alone carried six English and fewer non-English rg cues, so deleting the block would reopen the misroutes that fix closed. The honest measurement is 40 and is recorded rather than hidden; the path back to 0 is to grow the shell-intent rg cues to this coverage and drop the capability-side copy."
  ceiling
    measure intent_routing_phrase_rows
    value 300
    direction down
    how "phrase and keyword rows of data/seed/intent-routing.lino"
    note "measured 354 on 2026-09-16; 477 was the file's former line count, not this measure. Lowered 354 to 343 on 2026-09-20 by plan 10 leaf 20 family one retiring the http_fetch family's exact-match rows: eleven phrases and one fetch token left the family, the measure counts the eleven phrases, and a URL-bearing fetch request is decided by the url object at the named-or-local stage plus the shared http_fetch role surfaces of meanings-web-navigation.lino, which the held-out paraphrase test pins in tests/unit/issue_1138_intent_phrase_migration.rs before and after. The token row is not counted by this measure; the family block keeps its slug and response_link. Lowered 343 to 337 on 2026-09-20 by leaf 20 family two retiring the web_search family's six phrase rows: each was a duplicate of a web_search_explicit_prefix surface in meanings-web-search-query.lino, the rows required whole-prompt equality so a surface-plus-query prompt never matched one, and the same test file pins Hindi and Chinese search prompts that no row ever covered as derived before and after. The drafting exposed one honest debt the retirement records rather than fixes: the solver's web-search seed carries no Spanish lexeme, so an es search prompt reaches the web_search intent derivation nowhere and answers as an unresolved concept lookup. Lowered 337 to 300 on 2026-09-20 by leaf 20 family three retiring the url_navigate family's thirty-seven bare-lead phrase rows: every row duplicated a url_navigate role prefix surface, a navigation prompt carries a host so whole-prompt equality never fired for one, and the issue 125 suite's twenty-nine host-bearing prompts still route to url_navigate with the rows gone while the same test file pins tail-varied paraphrases no row named."
  ceiling
    measure planner_route_arms
    value 58
    direction down
    how "top-level conditional route arms in plan_chat_step_routes and plan_settled_routes in src/agentic_coding/planner.rs"
    note "re-measured 59 on 2026-09-18 by the checker's own counting rule: the 58 recorded earlier the same day was a miscount, and the honest count was 59 both before and after leaf 11, which swapped the shared cue-phrase arm for the named-capability table arm at the same position (one arm out, one in). The count belongs to leaf 19 to lower; 45 was an unimplemented plan estimate. Lowered 59 to 58 on 2026-09-20 by plan 10 leaf 19 retiring the web_fetch arm: the decision table's five url rows decide that request class at the named-or-local stage with the same fetch_arguments lowering, so the arm was a second URL decision ahead of its own table backstop, and the 420-case suite measures 420 passing, 0 misroutes, 0 silent unknowns with it gone. Leaf 19 also proved four arms NOT covered before leaving them: workspace_inspection disabled fails the issue 1066 inspection pin because a scope-noun-less question derives locus web, file_read is a recipe whose read row has no table lowering for a client without the typed read tool, code_search_fallback serves grep-only clients the table honest-gaps, and intent_web_search carries the tool_search discovery call the table cannot express."
  ceiling
